---
import Experience from '../layouts/Experience.astro';
import { orgs } from '../data/profile';
---

<Experience org={orgs['foundations-it']}>
  <p>
    Foundations IT is where I really cut my teeth. I started as a software
    developer building an e-commerce platform in <strong>Angular</strong> and <strong
      >.NET</strong
    >: a customizable website builder, a shopping cart, and the onboarding flow
    that got new merchants up and running.
  </p>

  <p>
    After a stint at Vanguard I came back, and this time I grew into a <strong
      >team lead</strong
    >. I led a team of five-plus engineers: assigning work, running code
    reviews, and onboarding new hires. It's where I learned that shipping good
    software is as much about people and process as it is about code.
  </p>
</Experience>
